WEBVTT

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:28.230
Shintori-san

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:31.940
What?

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:36.080
Iroha and the wheat want you to do something for them.

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.650
What is it?

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:40.650
Iroha!

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.120
Mom, where are you going?

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:46.500
To the zoo.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:50.100
The penguins don't seem to be doing well, so I'm going to check on them.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:52.220
Mom, I'm going to work!

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:53.480
Mom?

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:57.960
Come to think of it, human wheat and mom go well together!

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.320
Nice to meet you, I'm Iroha's mother.

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:02.440
I'm Komugi!

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:05.420
Oh, you have the same name as my dog.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:06.120
That's right!

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:08.020
Because Komugi is Komugi!

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:10.390
That's right!

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:13.770
The name Komugi is the same!

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:15.940
I wonder if it's popular.

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:17.320
What?

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:22.410
I don't think it's my first time.

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:25.290
Did you meet him somewhere?

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:26.880
Well...

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:28.650
Every day at 8 o'clock!

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:33.040
Good morning.

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.940
Good morning.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:37.620
Eh? What's wrong?

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:41.700
I see. It's hard to keep it a secret from your family, isn't it?

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:46.050
I feel guilty and my chest hurts when I lie.

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.800
Why do you have to keep it a secret?

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:50.700
Because Meimei says,

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:50.940
No!

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:51.900
No!

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:52.890
No!

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:55.360
That's true, but...

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.310
It's impossible for animals to become humans.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:04.850
If they find out, it'll be a big mess, so I think it's better to keep it a secret.

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:10.090
That's right. I know, but it's not wonderful.

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:17.160
It's rare that Iroha-chan is not well.

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:18.990
I have a little problem.

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:20.170
What?

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:24.340
Kaniya-chan, is that true?

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:26.300
It's true, it's true.

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:29.480
Last night, I took my dad's car and passed the intersection.

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:32.280
The mirror stone was shining!

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:35.110
That's why I was in a hurry to ask for it.

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:37.120
I was hoping that it would be a live performance of my favorite singer.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.120
Isn't it a misunderstanding?

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:44.320
The car lights reflected on the mirror stone and it just looked like it was shining.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.730
Saruwatari!

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.560
You're going to do something like that right away!

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:51.260
It really shone!

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:52.660
I wonder!

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:55.760
What is a mirror stone?

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.100
Don't you know?

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:02.900
It's a big stone at the intersection of Hannibal Town.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:09.090
It's in the middle of the road, and it's said that if you can see the mirror stone, your wish will come true.

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:14.270
I wonder if I should ask the mirror stone.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:19.100
I hope I can be a big liar who can lie in peace.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:20.440
What?

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:22.380
Wait, calm down.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:24.370
You can't ask me for that.

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:26.820
I asked for a lot of wheat in the mirror stone.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:28.770
I want to talk to Iroha.

00:05:31.150 --> 00:05:32.690
Eh? Is that so?

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:40.360
Come to think of it, Inukai-san and Komugi-chan are also reflected in the compact mirror and change their appearance.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:44.500
The compact mirror that shines, and the legend of the mirror stone.

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:49.070
Perhaps the mirror stone may be a clue to solve various mysteries.

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:50.870
Really?

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:55.230
Why did Inukai-san and Komugi-chan become a pre-cure?

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:59.080
Why does Gargaru only appear in Animal Town?

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:01.890
It's a mystery, isn't it?

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:03.180
It's a mystery, isn't it?

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:09.870
I looked up the mirror stone in the library's books and on the internet, but in the end, I didn't understand anything.

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:29.020
When you say that, let's go get some flour!

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:37.520
Huh?

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:50.120
It's not Hirai-chan, it's a boy running!

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:51.220
Huh?

00:06:57.880 --> 00:06:59.040
A dog I don't know!

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:01.250
It's a dog called Papillon.

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:02.800
Let's go on a date!

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:04.950
Follow me!

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:19.280
That was a good run!

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:22.020
What's your name?

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.250
I'm Shinnosuke Nohara!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.450
I'm Shiro.

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:29.340
I'm Iroha from the dog world.

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:31.050
This one is wheat

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.090
Konegi?

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:34.140
Ah...

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:35.230
Komugi

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:37.180
Tamanegi

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:37.480
Again!

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:43.720
The dog spoke

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:47.520
Giii

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:50.360
It's bad

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:51.750
If you cheat...

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:52.890
Hoho

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:56.240
Animal Town dogs are pretty good too

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:58.810
I can talk to Siro too

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.160
Hey, Siro.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:08.110
Siro told me that you are a wonderful kindergarten child who can rely on me a lot.

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:12.620
I didn't say that.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:18.960
It's hard to keep up with you because you run around.

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:20.360
Yeah, yeah.

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:22.370
No, that's enough.

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:27.530
It's perfect.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:32.380
What?

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:34.880
My dad and mom are over there.

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:36.260
Oh dear.

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:40.940
My dad and mom will get lost because they're wandering around on their own.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.180
That's a problem.

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:45.750
That's because Shin-chan is lost.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:49.090
Iroha-chan! Komugi-chan!

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:50.660
Let's play together again!

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:57.420
Okay, let's go!

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:58.380
Let's go!

00:08:58.580 --> 00:08:59.980
The Cucumber Wind...

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:09.740
You were a funny girl. You talked to wheat normally.

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.320
It was fun to chat.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:17.380
That's right. It's fun and good to chat.

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:23.880
No! I'll keep Nico Garden and the animals a secret.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.880
That's what Nico-sama told me.

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:29.590
What? But...

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.040
I think you'll understand if you talk to me.

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:33.450
Mayu and I are good friends.

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:35.500
I think I can talk to someone I can trust.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:39.500
It's okay if it's Inukai-san's parents.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:47.070
I want to respect Satoru-kun's opinion, but...

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:47.610
Oh?

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:49.520
No!

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:52.910
You can't say that!

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:55.380
What do you mean no?

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.260
Is there a sheep?

00:09:58.260 --> 00:09:58.420
Is there a sheep?

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:01.900
It's an emergency!

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:04.360
But fortunately I'm a sheep!

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:06.580
If I just touch a sheep...

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:08.500
MEEEEEEEEEEE

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:13.260
I'm not a sheep!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.000
I'm a sheep of sheep!

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:21.690
M-MEEEEEEEEEEE

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:04.590
I'm so happy to be able to talk to my dad and mom.

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:12.720
It's amazing. It's amazing. It's a dream to be able to talk to wheat.

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:15.260
It's like an old story in Kagaminshi.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:18.110
That's right. It's similar.

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:19.960
An old story?

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.970
It's a story that's been told for a long time.

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:29.910
Once upon a time, humans and animals were close friends around here.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:37.200
living in peace. One day, an animal that wanted to get along with humans more asked God.

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:51.730
God, please let me talk to humans. Then, God gave me a shining stone with a mysterious power.

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:59.440
When I asked for that stone, the animal became able to speak, and I got along with humans.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.140
They lived happily ever after.

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:04.740
That shining stone is Kagaminshi?

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:06.850
Yes. Isn't it similar to how wheat can speak?

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.500
Kagaminshi isn't sparkling.

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:14.750
There's more to the story.

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:17.260
After hearing the reputation of Kagaminshi,

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:19.870
a lot of creatures came,

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:23.190
and a road was built, and an animal town was built.

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:28.480
But the gathered creatures started to fight each other.

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:35.180
God was sad and turned the mirror stone into a mere stone.

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:40.050
If you pray to the mirror stone, your wish will come true.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:43.240
That's all that's left to say right now.

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:50.480
But...

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:16.520
What's wrong?

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:20.050
Dad, Mom, I have to go!

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:21.500
Komugi!

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:41.080
I'm going to make flour.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:45.110
I'm sorry, I'll explain it later.

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:55.930
I'm late for your greeting. My name is Meimei.

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:59.710
Iroha-sama and Komugi-sama are always the same.

00:13:59.710 --> 00:13:59.790
Bye!

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.120
Thank you for taking care of me.

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:03.190
Leave!

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:27.830
If you don't leave, you don't need to be a slave.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:29.760
I'm just...

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:32.360
I just protected what I wanted to protect.

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:34.630
The rest is up to her.

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:44.160
Let's go, wheat!

00:14:56.550 --> 00:14:57.150
My Evolution!

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:38.840
Let me hear Secure Frienda's voice!

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:45.160
Right, Preview?

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:02.930
Hello, Garu-Garu!

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:06.580
Hello, Garu-Garu!

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:07.500
Hello!

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:10.320
Say hello!

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:12.890
You're a polite kid.

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.030
Maybe we can talk.

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:18.370
I'm Cure Friendly.

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:19.550
What's your name?

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:23.750
Cure!

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:27.470
That's Inko's Garu-Garu!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.340
He's just imitating other people's words!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:30.300
Devil!

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:03.520
If that's the case, then...

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:30.820
Time's up!

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:08.000
Let's play together!

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:34.130
Waffle for you!

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:19.660
Wait here. I'll give it back to everyone.

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:32.440
Welcome home!

00:19:32.580 --> 00:19:44.460
Welcome home!

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:45.950
Welcome home!

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:47.190
Eh?

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.810
Meimei-chan's tea is very delicious!

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:52.670
I'm looking forward to it!

00:19:53.070 --> 00:19:55.140
Well then, everyone, please come in!

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:57.830
Um, what's the situation?

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:06.990
I heard that the animals in Nico Garden are lost in Animal Town, and they're looking for them.

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:09.140
Uh...

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:13.900
Great! Help! No, what?

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:15.190
You're helping animals!

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:19.390
You two are great!

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:28.660
Recently, I was wondering if you were hiding something, but I thought you were doing your best for someone because it's Iroha.

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:34.580
Dad, Mom, I can't get wheat either!

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:37.280
However, you don't have to force it.

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:41.740
If something happens, tell your dad and mom right away, okay?

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:47.660
I kept it a secret.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:49.960
I'm going to worry about you.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:53.060
Thank you, Meimei.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:57.060
Satoru-kun, Meimei-chan, how about dinner together?

00:20:58.500 --> 00:20:59.360
Ah, yes.

00:21:00.090 --> 00:21:01.370
I'll take your word for it.

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:08.610
I'm glad you accepted me, mom and dad.

00:21:09.070 --> 00:21:15.410
I'm glad you accepted me, mom and dad.

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:17.220
Here you go.

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:20.870
Wow, this smells good.

00:21:21.890 --> 00:21:22.670
It'll be fresh if you can get it at Nico Garden.

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:26.580
Let's talk and eat together.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:36.120
I got a call from Iroha-chan.

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:38.960
The problem has been solved.

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:42.460
Amazing.

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:44.200
Even though I was so worried,

00:21:45.020 --> 00:21:50.200
I will do my best to save the animals who are suffering from this.

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:57.860
I hope I can be like Iroha-chan.

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:03.360
I'll protect you!
